        "title": "[2607.25925] dtControl2+$\\varepsilon$: Trading Optimality for Explainability in MDPs via Decision Trees",
        "description": "Abstract page for arXiv paper 2607.25925: dtControl2+$\\varepsilon$: Trading Optimality for Explainability in MDPs via Decision Trees",
